<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fleet Intelligence · Asset Performance Dashboard</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>📊</text></svg>">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,400;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: #0a1a2b;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        /* ----- HEADER ----- */
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9edf2;
        }
        .logo {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .logo span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1e3a, #1f3a60);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .nav a {
            color: #1e293b;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 28px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            color: #0b1e3a;
        }
        .cta-button {
            background: #0b1e3a;
            color: white !important;
            padding: 10px 28px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            margin-left: 24px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background: #1f3a60;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* ----- HERO ----- */
        .hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 60px 0 80px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            color: #0a1a2b;
        }
        .hero h1 .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0b1e3a, #2a4b7a);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #475569;
            margin: 24px 0 32px;
            max-width: 480px;
        }
        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: #0b1e3a;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 40px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: 0.2s;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1f3a60;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(11, 30, 58, 0.2);
        }
        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            color: #0a1a2b;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1.5px solid #d0d8e3;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: #0b1e3a;
            background: #f1f4f9;
        }
        .hero-image {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #e9edf2;
        }
        .hero-image img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: block;
        }

        /* ----- FEATURES ----- */
        .features {
            padding: 60px 0 80px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9edf2;
        }
        .features h2 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .features-sub {
            text-align: center;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 48px;
        }
        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* ----- PRICING ----- */
        .pricing {
            padding: 60px 0 80px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .pricing h2 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .pricing-card {
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 32px auto 0;
            background: white;
            padding: 40px 32px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            border: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        .pricing-price {
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0a1a2b;
        }
        .pricing-price span {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #64748b;
        }
        .pricing ul {
            list-style: none;
            text-align: left;
            margin: 24px 0 32px;
        }
        .pricing ul li {
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f4f9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .pricing ul li::before {
            content: "✓";
            color: #0b1e3a;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .pricing .btn-primary {
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* ----- CTA ----- */
        .cta-section {
            background: #0b1e3a;
            color: white;
            padding: 64px 0;
            border-radius: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .cta-section h2 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .cta-section p {
            color: #b9c8e0;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }
        .cta-section .btn-primary {
            background: #f0b90b;
            color: #0b1e3a;
        }
        .cta-section .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #f5c947;
        }

        /* ----- FOOTER ----- */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #0b1e3a;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* ----- RESPONSIVE ----- */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 40px 0;
                gap: 40px;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.4rem;
            }
            .feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .header {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 16px;
            }
            .nav a {
                margin-left: 12px;
                font-size: 0.85rem;
            }
            .cta-button {
                margin-left: 0;
                padding: 8px 20px;
            }
            .feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            .pricing-card {
                padding: 24px 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="container header">
    <div class="logo"><span>📊 FleetIntel</span></div>
    <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#cta" class="cta-button">Try It Free</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="container hero">
        <div>
            <h1>See exactly which machines are <span class="highlight">costing you money</span></h1>
            <p>Upload your fleet data and get a live dashboard with maps, filters, and real-time loss metrics. Stop guessing — start fixing.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="#cta" class="btn-primary">Start Free Trial</a>
                <a href="#demo" class="btn-outline">▶ Live Demo</a>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8;">No credit card required · 14-day free trial</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
